      "id": "total_weight_zero_at_notification",
      "kind": "precondition",
      "text": "At the time notifyRewardAmount() is called, IVoter(voter).totalWeight() returns zero, which can legitimately occur during early protocol operation or when voting weights temporarily drop to zero.",
